Cube class - cube draw and prgram run
    Methods:
        settings - initial cub parameters to draw
        setup - cam start to use with the mouse
        turn X, Y, Z - turn all mini cubes of one face usin 2D matrix
        draw - draw and update draw
        move - all possible cub moves
        keypressed - move with keyboar controls written down
     Subclases: Box, Face, Move

     Box - all mini cubes are box clases
     Face - Colors on big cub faces
     Move - colors anc big cub moves

Class Cubies - Solution algorithm
    Movement Methods:
        turnCW - clock wise turn of one cube face
        turnCCW - counter clock wise turn of one cub face

    Solution Methods:
        1)makeCross - use the curren big cube position and make a cross of on the UP face
        2)solveCorners - solve the UP cube face ordering the corners after makeCross method
        3)solve edges - solve the edges of the secont cub layer
        -------------------------------------------------------------
        3)solveFinalCorners - solve the corners of last cub layer(Down)
        4)solveFinalCross - solve the last cross
        ------------possible variation--------------------------
        4)solveFinalCross - solve the last cross
        3)solveFinalCorners - solve the corners of last cub layer(Down)

Controls

UP -> q, r
FRONT -> a, s
RIGHT -> z, x
BACK -> e, r
DOWN -> d, f
LEFT -> c, v

Automatic moves -> 1